    <!-- Onboarding / Guide -->
    <string name="guide_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="guide_subtitle">Follow these 3 simple steps to configure your Xiaomi MIX Flip:</string>
    <string name="guide_step1_title">Step 1: Shizuku (Required)</string>
    <string name="guide_step1_desc">Shizuku must be running and authorized for Flip Continuity Manager. It provides secure ADB shell permissions (UID 2000) to communicate with HyperOS without needing root.</string>
    <string name="guide_step2_title">Step 2: Outer Cover Screen (Tab 2)</string>
    <string name="guide_step2_desc">Before an application can run on the cover screen, it MUST be allowed in the \'Outer Screen\' tab (use \'Enable all\' or toggle individual apps).\n\n⚠️ Note: HyperOS resets this in-memory list on phone reboot. If apps stop launching on the outer screen after restarting your device, simply open this app and tap \'Apply after reboot\'!</string>
    <string name="guide_step3_title">Step 3: Flip Continuity (Tab 1)</string>
    <string name="guide_step3_desc">Ensure \'Global Continuity\' is enabled at the top, then turn on switches for the apps you want to seamlessly continue playing or working after closing the flip.</string>
    <string name="guide_btn_got_it">Got it!</string>
</resources>
